Package: totaljs-conky
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: conky-all, systemd
Homepage: https://www.totaljs.com
Description: The desktop widget of Total.js Developer
 A Conky widget on the wallpaper, drawn with Cairo, with four profiles: the system (processor, memory and disk as
 rings, the network and the processes), the services (Docker, the proxy, Code, Flow, PostgreSQL, Total.js Center and
 SSH), a compact card and a clock. The command totaljs-conky changes the profile or hides it, and the session
 starts the one that the person chose.
